- Copy the source code, or any substantial part of it, into other software or services.
- Use the Software or its source code to build a competing product.
- Use the source code to train, fine-tune or evaluate machine learning or AI models.
- Remove or alter copyright notices, this license, or the attribution of the Software.
- Claim authorship or ownership of the Software or of its source code.

